{"version":1,"content":"<p>姜濤早前於MIRROR團綜《MIRROR ACE》中，為爭取小朋友歡心而出動美食誘惑，在現場大叫「或者有人主動肯給我『心』，每人lunch time有一個漢堡包吃！</p><p>我叫姜濤！</p><p>我們這裏是濤Team！</p><p>有沒有人想join我們team的！</p><p>知道嗎？</p><p>Join我們team會有什麼？</p><p>漢堡包，right？</p><p>」在美食攻勢下，數十名小朋友隨即被吸引。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T05:59:17.607279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:11:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:34.524814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T05:57:34.999481+00:00","content_hash":"4d4d342ebcbb6340900031a5541fb938c54f87b838dfe8db69591ae57370d79d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}